# One Sensor, one Blocker, one pump. A Time floored to the hour is never
# later than itself, so `control` and `guarded` fire and `negated`'s Blocker
# blocks it.
#
#   seen = 1700000000000000000  2023-11-14T22:13:20Z, floored to 22:00:00
assert Sensor entity_id=s seen=1700000000000000000
assert Blocker entity_id=b seen=1700000000000000000
pump
